{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13d0_level_act13d0_st02",
  "groupId": "act13d0",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "域外同族",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d0/level_act13d0_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "238250115dc97764583f6511b0ded3426e33489adcb16c1dd113ab2c6047a732",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "异域同族"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "武器可靠性证明？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "需要我本人带着武器，去工坊接受检查，然后拿工匠的签名回来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "使用自带武器，竟然还要走这种流程啊......啧，听起来就好麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "老师就不能通融一下，直接帮我签掉不就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "不可以？这是罗德岛的规矩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "真没意思。好吧，好吧，如果您坚持的话，我就自己去一趟吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "初来乍到，我也不想这么快就惹那位凯尔希医生生气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那就一会见了，老师。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗德岛舰船，第三维修工坊，早晨"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "有没有人在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "您好，现在工坊不营业，五位工匠都去参加维修竞技比赛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "有需要的话请下午三点再来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "维修竞技？那是什么怪比赛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "要先把武器弄坏再比怎么维修吗，还是看看谁把刀柄擦得更亮？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "很遗憾，只是普通的针对战场上半损毁武器的修缮和改良比赛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但如果真的能将武器擦到足够亮，让这变成一种攻击手段，或许也不是不能取得优胜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......嗯？好像是个不错的主意。下次我试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哈，怪人。随便吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我可不想为了这么点事还要再跑一趟，没有工匠在，但这里不是还有你吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "反正也只是例行公事的检查，别那么较真。怎么样，这位朋友，帮我简单看一下，然后填个证明就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "武器可靠性证明？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "武器可靠性证明需要两位工匠同时进行检查后签字确认。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我算是还在实习的助手，就算签上自己的名字也不管用，帮不了你这个忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "需要两个人签字，这里有你我两个人，这不是正好吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我自己的法杖，自己最清楚，不会有什么问题的。只要不出事，就没人会知道，没人知道，就是没有问题，不是吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊这个想法有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但还是别小看这里的其他人会比较好哦，特别是比较严肃的那几位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "万一出了事，就是重大事故了，别说我们，连不在场的工匠都要一起受罚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "啧，死板，麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但是有效。有些人就是想不起来维护武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "总比在战场上换弦要来得轻松。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哪会有那种傻子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "算了。既然如此，那就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "只请你帮忙看下武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "这还是可以的吧。总不能真的白跑一趟，那也有点让人不爽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊......也好。稍等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "等我拧好这最后一颗螺丝——好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "久等了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......嗯，看你的表情，看来你还是在盘算什么，并没有打算彻底放弃呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "这是说什么，我可听不明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "来，给你。我的法杖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哎.....算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "好吧，那我来检查一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（小声）只要小心一些，别出事故，应该就没关系了吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "就拜托你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "武器的检查会需要一些时间，要麻烦你在这里稍微等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "参观的话可以随意，但工坊里的东西最好还是不要随便碰，总有些工匠师傅喜欢做些比较危险的东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你明白吧？那种做到一半的半成品只会更危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "而且，这里还有不少混杂着源石成分的矿石......就算你是感染者，也最好小心一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "不劳担心。我还没有那么莽撞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "怪了，我有提过自己是感染者这件事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "没有。但要看出来不难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "说说，怎么看出来的？很明显吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯......解释起来有点难，我也说不清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "就靠多多观察吧，从大家的神情、动作，还有行为逻辑上，都可以看出很多东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "听起来像是在糊弄人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是真的啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "只有这根法杖要检查吗？如果还有其他的，我也可以帮你看一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "没有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "很遗憾，我没有守护铳需要检查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "真巧，我也没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "你这人真奇怪，有点意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯......谢谢夸奖？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "没夸你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "这根法杖没有使用上的问题。随便看看就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "还是要仔细点的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯......材质很高端呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "法杖上悬挂着的东西也是施法源吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "是。不过更多是个人兴趣，能打人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那也挺好的，近身战会很有利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "工匠，怎么称呼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "我可还算不上工匠啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "预备行动组A4小队的成员，安德切尔，顺带在这里兼职当学徒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "你怎么称呼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "芳汀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "听上去很适合你呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "嗯......主要施术单元没有损伤，下面悬挂的施术源表面也没有明显的裂痕或破碎痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "看起来状态不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "嗯哼，我说过了，不会有什么问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "那接下来，能请你用法杖驱动一下自己的源石技艺吗？这样我可以从运行反馈里确认法杖的运行状态。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "就这么施术？我的源石技艺不怎么平和哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "哦，能简单描述下类型吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "分解、毒素。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "呜哇，听起来确实挺危险的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "那就把法杖放在旁边的透明柜子里，然后把手从柜子旁的入口伸进去，使用一下能力就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "这样就算你的能力有强挥发性，也完全不用担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "是不是很方便？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "好烦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "行，好，就这样吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "可以了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "可以了，我操作下机器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "如果感到腕部受到压迫，请不要在意，那是正常现象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "现在可以使用你的源石技艺啦，不用担心会伤到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "谁担心了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（使用源石技艺）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "好了，完成了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "接下来就全是我的工作了，请把法杖交给我，然后到旁边去休息一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我还以为萨科塔人都只对铳和弩感兴趣呢，看你好像对法杖也很熟悉，域外的萨科塔都是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "只是带我的铁锤师傅擅长维护锻造法杖，小队里也有朋友的武器需要保养。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "擅长做法杖，代号却叫铁锤？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "师傅们起名随意的很，我第一次来实习的时候也愣了半天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "喏，师傅们的工位牌都挂那里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "你要是感兴趣可以随便看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那我就不客气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（第三维修工坊工匠名单）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（铁锤、锡罐、石头、毁盾、弃械）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（这也太随意了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（不过，这或许会是一个好机会......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "工匠们都要把自己的签名铸在工牌上吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "怎么会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "那只是师傅们一时赌气的产物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "有一天他们在工艺上出了点争执，然后所有人都用自己熟悉的工艺给打了块工牌和别人比试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "消了气之后，大家都觉得这还挺好玩，所以就约定在工坊里用自己做的工牌，外出的时候用公司配发的统一工牌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "有意思吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "很有......意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（每个人的签名都在上面。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（全是手写。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（不错。能省我不少事情，只要随便挑两个弄到手......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（偷瞄）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（哈，时机正好。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（拓印......)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "(成了。源石技艺还真便利。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（嗯？这个签名，还是拉特兰语的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "安德切尔，这个工匠是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "哦，那是弃械师傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "从拉特兰来，和我们一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "但师傅从不做铳械相关的东西，只喜欢打剑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "怎么，难道他也没有守护铳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "守护铳师傅还是有的啦，师傅只是不喜欢铳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "听说他把铳留在了拉特兰的家中，再也没有回去过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "“那个到处都是弹壳的地方，我见了就头疼。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "师傅是这么说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "说的不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我有预感，我会和这个人合得来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "唉，可惜师傅因为这事和家里人闹掰了，拉特兰都不方便回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "如果那位师傅真的像你说的那样讨厌铳，在拉特兰生活，估计不会有太多美好回忆吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "即便如此，也还是会想回去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "拉特兰真的有这么值得怀念？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "这么一说，这个问题我好像没想过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "你呢，你怀念拉特兰吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "嗯......很难说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "我很久以前就不在拉特兰生活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "因为光环的原因。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "而在之后又得了矿石病，就更加没法回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "所以，你的光环位置......不是因为矿石病？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "是啊，我天生就和别人不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那可......真惨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "因为小时候爸妈总是笑着这样说，总是夸奖我，所以我到现在都觉得这确实是件幸运的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "天生就与众不同，听起来就很帅气吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "啊当然，这只是玩笑话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "不必谦虚。你确实是个与众不同的怪人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "是吗？其实我觉得自己还蛮普通的啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "和其他萨科塔人都差不多，共通点很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "比如说？什么共通点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "比如......嗯，比如我也戴不上套头帽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "咳咳 ，嗯，是，确实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那东西戴上就像是把人裹在没缝的蛋里一样，恶心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "除了那些专业训练过的家伙，比如公证所还有教宗骑士那群人，还有一些战斗狂之外，没多少萨科塔人能忍受那个吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "是这样没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "总之，大概是因为光环的原因吧，我没能通过持铳的资格审查，在那之后没多久我们一家就离开拉特兰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "矿石病也是在之后才染上的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "拉特兰的土地不接纳感染者，你在感染后，也没再回去过吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "所以，我对拉特兰......并不是很怀念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "小时候发生的许多事情我都不太记得了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "啊，不过我还记得街角的若望师傅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "他教会了我做甜点，在我走的时候还把店里所有甜点的制作方式印成图册送给我了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（啧......来了，萨科塔们逃不过的甜食。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "如果我没在搬家的时候丢失那本图册的话，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（每年父母都会给我准备一个大蛋糕，他们知道我吃不下，却还是把我一个人留在家里，对付那个，甜到发腻的糖块。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "但至少，我可以把弹头麦芬做得和若望师傅的麦芬一丝不差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "我到现在还记得甜点店里的麦香味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "（我也记得很清楚，香味，每次闻到就觉得喉咙不舒服。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "咦，原来你不喜欢甜点啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "这还是挺少见的，我头一次见到不喜欢甜点的拉特兰人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......又是你看出来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "一般我不太会这样直接说出来，因为有很多人会不太开心，有时我就干脆不说话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "不过，我觉得你看起来不像是很在意这些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "行吧，确实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我不在意哦。怪人总比普通人有意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "不喜欢甜点的话，那你可比我要怪多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "下次我可以尝试做点不太甜的点心，到时候再喊你来尝尝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "也不知道老师傅现在还好吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "一会或许可以请后勤的信使们帮个忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我明白了一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "你是个地地道道的拉特兰萨科塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "虽然持不了铳，光环也不正。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "你说得没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "我在那里存有回忆，不能回去的只是城市，不是家。故乡是不论何时都可以触碰的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "城际间的来回、书信、传讯、照片。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "如果真的想怀念，不是很方便吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这话说得还有点道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "但有人就是喜欢闻闻气味，摸摸土墙，来个故地重游，不然就要得上思乡症咯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "虽然我都无所谓就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "只要你们分享甜点的时候带上我就行，不太甜的我也吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "你好，安比尔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "喔，你也好，新来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "我该叫你什么，小帅哥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "芳汀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你好芳汀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "安德切尔，还是老样子，枪就拜托你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "你放那儿就好，我还在处理芳汀的武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "唔，什么味道，香香的，好像不是市面上有得卖的种类......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "有人涂香水了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "如果你喜欢，可以来我这里多吸几口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "嗯......那还是算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "总觉得没什么好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "不过啊，如果你的香气能让我昏睡一天的话，我倒是可以考虑一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "那个成天板着脸的家伙又要来找我“履行义务”了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "与其想办法逃跑，还是昏迷一天比较实际。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "不过就他们的死脑筋程度，昏迷一天可能还不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "好烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "板着脸的家伙，你是说公证所的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "还能有谁啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你就不会被他们找吗？说是要监督履行公民责任与义务什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "也会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "不过上一个在我午睡的时候突然砸我的门的家伙，现在还在为了替我解决一些事情而四处奔走呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "虽然他们很麻烦，但他们也很擅长处理麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "只要用人用得好，那点麻烦不算什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "哇哦，你说话像个反派。挺不错的嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我该说谢谢夸奖吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "倒也不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "芳汀，你的法杖已经检查完毕了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "除了施术回路有些腐蚀，其他的地方都没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "轻微的腐蚀不会影响到施术，但如果你要做养护，我现在也可以帮你处理一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "下午等工匠们回来，你就可以找他们签可靠性证明了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "（小声）虽然你可能已经不需要了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "来，拿好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "接下来是安比尔的长铳——嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "拜托啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "你......不自己调试铳吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "调呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "但有时候就是懒得调，怎么办呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那就等着它坏掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "这个嘛......还是不行的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "没了它就领不了工资。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "没了工资就连偷懒的机会都不会有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "我才不会做这种傻事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哼......你还挺正经的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "如果生活里真的可以用不上铳枪，把它放在角落里堆灰也不是不能接受啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "哦，在拉特兰可能是有机会的，但要是真积灰，第二天就会被不知哪里冒出来的亲戚朋友怒目瞪视，很烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "所以，我放弃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "安比尔，铳没有问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "本来就没问题，上周刚校过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "帮我擦一下上油就可以啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "好吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "这时候你是不是觉得铳带在身边很累赘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "还好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "办法总会有的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "就像你离开拉特兰，跑来这里那样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "你真的很不客气，对刚见面的女孩子说话这么直白，会不受欢迎的哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那真是不好意思，你感到被冒犯了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "倒是还好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "差不多，就算是那样吧。我的确不太适合那里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "比起当个守城小工，天天被人唠叨荣耀荣耀的，我还是更愿意让自己的钱包鼓一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "过得自在一点，舒服一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "挺好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "看来你对拉特兰没什么留念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "只要过得好，哪里都行吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "再说，也没人规定萨科塔要一辈子呆在拉特兰啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "大地那么广，多看看嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "枪好了安比尔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "谢啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "唔，比我擦得亮多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安比尔",
      "text": "那你们慢慢聊，我先回去休息了，再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "再见！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "快到饭点了，芳汀你还有什么需要我帮忙的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "没有的话我要锁工坊的门去吃饭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "要不要一起来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "不了，我和那位叫送葬人的公证所干员有约，他好像有点事要通知我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "你说顺带把安比尔出没的情报带给他，他会不会卖我个人情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "呃？说笑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "是哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "你太爱开玩笑啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "虽然我可以看得出，但是其他人或许会产生误会，还是稍微注意一点比较好哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "不劳担心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "对了，下午你还在这里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安德切尔",
      "text": "嗯？我会在啊。吃完午饭我就会回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "你知道吗，虽然你的观察力确实不一般，但你还是看错了一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "下午我还会来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那位弃械师傅的故事听起来很有意思，如果是为了见他一面，再跑一趟也不是不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "那就下午再见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "我回来了，老师。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "当然，我当然已经去过工坊了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "啊......但是这个不可以交给您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "您看出来了？工坊不巧没有人在，这上面的签名是拓印的，不是工匠本人的签名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "唉，看来就算原本想拿这个交差，也还是会被识破啊。罗德岛的博士果然很敏锐，安德切尔那家伙倒是没说错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "放心，下午我还会再去一趟的。再给我一份证明书吧，等工匠们参加完比赛，我就可以问他们要真正的签名了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "嗯？我突然变老实了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哈哈，别这么说嘛，我一直都很听老师的话，不是吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "哎，老师，您那是什么表情啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "转变心意的理由？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "发现了不少有意思的人，为此花费一些时间也不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "怎么样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芳汀",
      "text": "这听起来算不算是一个好理由？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
